{
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "Slingshot 的起点是 n×J 的归一化表达矩阵，因此 normalized_expression=present 满足其基本输入形式。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "We start from an n×J matrix of normalized expression measures (e.g., read counts) for n single cells and J genes or features."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Slingshot 假设细胞已被划分为 K 个簇，cluster_labels=present 与这一算法假设相符。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "Slingshot assumes that the n cells have been partitioned into K clusters, potentially corresponding to distinct cellular states."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "降维不是硬性必需条件：Slingshot 原则上可直接用于归一化表达，但强烈推荐先降维。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "Although Slingshot can in principle be applied directly to the normalized expression measures, we strongly recommend a dimensionality reduction step before pseudotemporal reconstruction"
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "推荐降维的原因是曲线拟合使用欧氏距离，在高维空间可能表现不佳。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "Slingshot’s curve-fitting step uses Euclidean (or related) distances, which can misbehave in high-dimensional spaces (cf. curse of dimensionality)."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你已提供 reduced_dimensions=present，因此推荐条件也已满足。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": [
        "user:reduced_dimensions"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "已知末端簇是可选的局部监督，不决定所有谱系的数量。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 3,
          "quote": "Additionally, Slingshot optionally allows the user to provide further supervision in the inference of the lineages by selecting clusters known to represent terminal cell states, imposing a local constraint on the MST algorithm."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "提醒：论文版本要求用户指定初始簇或根节点，但这属于版本特定说明，不能据此推断所有软件版本都必须显式传入根参数。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 7,
          "quote": "Slingshot requires the user to identify the initial cluster or root node."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "提醒：包描述中“在降维和聚类之后作为分析流程组件”只是流程定位，不能当作精确的通用硬性输入门槛。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 6,
          "quote": "Slingshot was designed to model developmental trajectories in single-cell RNA sequencing data and serve as a component in an analysis pipeline after dimensionality reduction and clustering."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    }
  ],
  "clarification": null
}
